    description: "Compare the revalidation session against the initial March 1 run to measure impact of\nthe ~15 PRs that landed between them.\n\nCommands:\n  ./scripts/bakeoff-features compare deep-20260301-063114 <new-session-dir>\n\nRecord in the lab notebook:\n- Per-repo delta table: verdict changes (GOOD↔WARN), metric changes (orphan rate, tier1%,\n  avg_slice_nodes, total nodes/edges)\n- Identify regressions: any repo that moved GOOD→WARN or whose LLM score dropped\n- Identify improvements: WARN→GOOD transitions, LLM score increases\n- Per-cohort aggregate: how many GOOD/WARN changed in each cohort\n\nThe initial run's diagnostic data is at:\n  ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/deep-20260301-063114/diag/cohort-{001..007}/iter-001/report.yaml\nThe initial run's reflect data is at:\n  ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/deep-20260301-063114/reflect/cohort-{001..007}/iter-001/summary.yaml"  # 6cda
